From 8d747e48038a56d3438890a837c74509a1fe62f1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: cheng343 <203324649+cheng343@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:36:40 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] aeraui: prompt for language before decryption on first boot
 (opt-in)

Shown only when AERA_FIRST_BOOT_LANGUAGE is enabled and the build ships more than one language. BeginDecryption() now builds the credential page through a shared ShowDecryptScene() helper and offers the chooser before it; choosing a language or skipping both record the decision and continue, so decryption is never blocked.
---
 aeraui/Android.bp                           |  1 +
 aeraui/build/aeraui_defaults.go             |  6 ++
 aeraui/core/engine.cpp                      | 50 ++++++++++-
 aeraui/include/aeraui/backend.hpp           |  4 +
 aeraui/include/aeraui/engine.hpp            |  2 +
 aeraui/platform/aera_backend.cpp            | 45 +++++++++-
 aeraui/scenes/first_boot_language_scene.cpp | 95 +++++++++++++++++++++
 aeraui/scenes/scene.hpp                     |  5 ++
 8 files changed, 205 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 aeraui/scenes/first_boot_language_scene.cpp

